    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout single\" data-layout=\"single\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"BahmniConnectApp-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p>Bahmni Connect allows a user to access Bahmni in areas with limited internet connectivity. This is especially useful for <span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Community_health_worker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Community Health Workers</a> (CHWs) to use Bahmni to register patients, view medical records, and enter brief treatment data in remote, internet-lacking locations. The CHW can later come into an area with connectivity to a Bahmni server, and <em>synchronize</em> the app on their Android device/Chromebook with the Bahmni server.</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-warning conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"d0c3232b-cc7d-45af-9915-6449ebaffd63\" data-macro-name=\"warning\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-error confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>WARNING: Bahmni Connect App is no longer being maintained. Instead please see the Bahmni Outreach App, for Offline-ready, CHW Mobile App here: <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3238625296/Bahmni+Outreach+App+for+Community+Healthcare+Offline+ready\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3238625296\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Bahmni Outreach App for Community Healthcare (Offline ready)</a></p></div></div><p><br/></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"73db817b-a3ca-4db6-811b-7851d15b0b56\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>You can also watch this video walkthrough of the Bahmni Connect app: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5mzrDE6G2rA\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/5mzrDE6G2rA</a></p></div></div><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"columnLayout three-equal\" data-layout=\"three-equal\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"75cc2741-ab64-44c9-b537-0a202bfb8299\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">Sections</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"28bbf201-d4bb-472c-865e-0ceb60581fb2\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535704/Installing+and+Configuring+Bahmni+Connect\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535704\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Installing and Configuring Bahmni Connect</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535706/Installing+Bahmni+Connect+on+Server\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535706\" data-linked-resource-version=\"4\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Installing Bahmni Connect on Server</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535723/Connect+Installation+Steps+on+Server\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535723\" data-linked-resource-version=\"10\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Connect Installation Steps on Server</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535719/Server+Setup+For+Connect\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535719\" data-linked-resource-version=\"30\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Server Setup For Connect</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535725/Bahmni+Connect+Sync\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535725\" data-linked-resource-version=\"12\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Bahmni Connect Sync</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535730/Installing+Bahmni+Connect+App\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535730\" data-linked-resource-version=\"3\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Installing Bahmni Connect App</a><ul class=\"childpages-macro\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535733/Connect+Requirements\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535733\" data-linked-resource-version=\"23\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Connect Requirements</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535735/Installation+Steps+-+Connect\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535735\" data-linked-resource-version=\"36\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Installation Steps - Connect</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/325713930/Setup+Bahmni+Connect+using+Location+based+sync+strategy\" data-linked-resource-id=\"325713930\" data-linked-resource-version=\"10\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Setup Bahmni Connect using Location based sync strategy</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535739/Customizing+Bahmni+Connect\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535739\" data-linked-resource-version=\"52\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Customizing Bahmni Connect</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/97026058/Change+Bahmni+Connect+App+Location\" data-linked-resource-id=\"97026058\" data-linked-resource-version=\"15\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Change Bahmni Connect App Location</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535737/Upgrade+Bahmni+Connect\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535737\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Upgrade Bahmni Connect</a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/108494885/Bahmni+Connect+Performance+Baseline\" data-linked-resource-id=\"108494885\" data-linked-resource-version=\"24\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Bahmni Connect Performance Baseline</a></li></ul><p> </p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"f5e76242-9ad1-477e-9fa2-70ff0a12c473\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535750/Bahmni+Connect\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535750\" data-linked-resource-version=\"40\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Bahmni Connect</a></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"b94e3ad7-5c3a-4de1-9e38-0d0d4195b78d\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Usage Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/94535745/Using+Bahmni+Connect+App\" data-linked-resource-id=\"94535745\" data-linked-resource-version=\"34\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Using Bahmni Connect App</a></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
